## Smoke run

One heavy-run wrapper, `HOME=/tmp/opencode/readers-smoke-2`, so that the print folder resolves inside
the temporary home and no file goes into `~/Desktop/print-ready/` (`jr-green-6883bd7d-smoke.txt`).
- `make-student-book-pdf.ts --level 2 --weeks 1 --proof --version 7` gives
  `Storytime-Advantage-L2-U1-Student-Book-v7_PDFX-1a.pdf`: 14 pages, 594.96 x 841.92 pts,
  PDF/X-1a:2001. `PRINT_GATE` (`make-pdfx.ts --check`) exits 0 with "All checks pass". 30 hits of
  "PICTURE MISSING": 18 on the reader sides of pages 9 to 14 and the 12 boxes of the earlier
  workbook pages.
- `make-readers-pdf.ts --level 2 --weeks 1 --proof --workbook` gives
  `Storytime-Advantage-L2-Readers-W01-v1_PDFX-1a.pdf`: 6 pages, 18 hits.
- The reader text prints in both files: "Hello, I am Pat.", "Nan can nod", "Sounds in this book",
  "Hello!", and the band "Sprout".
- The page count of the student workbook stays 14, as Phase 2 accepted it.

